<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr PPI 10.1 pct in Nov vs 9.8 pct Oct.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr PPI 10.1 pct in Nov vs 9.8 pct Oct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish producer prices rose 0.7 percent in November against a 0.8 percent rise in October, taking year-on-year producer price inflation up to 10.1 percent, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said PPI rose 10.2 percent in the January-November period, compared with a 18.3 percent rise in the corresponding period last year.  </p>
<p> POLISH PRODUCER INFLATION     NOVEMBER     OCTOBER NOVEMBER 95</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)		0.7	 0.8	 1.3</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		     10.1	 9.8	20.1</p>
<p>  manufacturing m/m change	     0.7	 0.7	 0.9</p>
<p>  manufacturing yr/yr change	  10.4	 9.8	20.6</p>
<p>  mining m/m change			1.1	 1.4	 1.6</p>
<p>  mining yr/yr change		    7.8	 7.4	23.4</p>
<p>  utilities m/m change		   0.2	 0.6	 0.6</p>
<p>  utilities yr/yr change		12.0	11.2	17.4</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
